    "_postman_id": "b7f092fc-110e-4dbd-ba88-02061e7a71c0",
    "name": "Juice Box",
    "description": "# Juice Box\n\n**Juice Box** is a general-purpose API collection that covers core application features including user authentication, content management, and weather data retrieval.\n\n## Folders\n\n### 👤 User & Login\n\nHandles all user-related operations and authentication flows:\n\n- **Get Specify User** – Retrieve details of a specific user\n    \n- **Register** – Create a new user account\n    \n- **Login** – Authenticate and obtain an access token\n    \n- **Logout** – Invalidate the current session\n    \n- **Check Token** – Verify the validity of an access token\n    \n\n### 📝 Post\n\nFull CRUD operations for managing posts:\n\n- **Get Posts** – Retrieve a list of all posts\n    \n- **Get Post** – Retrieve a single post by ID\n    \n- **Create Post** – Create a new post\n    \n- **Update Post** – Update an existing post\n    \n- **Delete Post** – Remove a post\n    \n\n### 🌤️ Weather\n\nProvides access to weather data:\n\n- **Get Weather** – Fetch current weather information\n    \n\n---\n\n> **Environment:** Uses the `Juice Box` environment. Make sure `local_juicebox` and `access_token` variables are set before running authenticated requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "54735322"
  },
